      },
      {
        "heading": "What are the largest agencies and markets for Atlantic Diving Supply?",
        "body": "The Department of Defense is the largest buying agency at $3.2B, followed by the General Services Administration at $93.5M and the Department of Homeland Security at $31.3M. The top markets are Service Establishment Equipment and Supplies Merchant Wholesalers at $1.9B, All Other Miscellaneous Manufacturing at $982M, and Bare Printed Circuit Board Manufacturing at $105M."
      }
